Khara answers shamed Śūrpaṇakhā with harsh comfort --- Khara promises to send Rāma and brother to Yama --- Śūrpaṇakhā praises brother despite earlier abuse --- Khara orders Dūṣaṇa to ready fourteen thousand demons --- Khara demands chariot bows arrows swords spears --- Dūṣaṇa shows sunlike chariot and Khara mounts --- Fourteen thousand demons march roaring from Janasthāna --- Khara follows in rattling chariot urging driver onward